WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.863
Watch and read: Ama asks: You read that Ama carries a book to the the market. Which

00:00:04.863 --> 00:00:05.960
fact can you share?

00:00:06.783 --> 00:00:10.751
The answer is: Ama carries a book.. Share facts stated in the text.

00:00:11.617 --> 00:00:16.801
Watch and read: Ama asks: Which is a respectful way to share a fact about the market?

00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:22.611
The answer is: Tell your partner and listen to their idea. Share accurate information

00:00:22.611 --> 00:00:24.038
and let others contribute.
